 does the person who is a journalist do?*\n- The Journalist is at Position 2. Their hobby is filmmaking.\n- Answer: filmmaking\n\n*Question 3: What is the job of the person who watches adventure?*\n- The person watching Adventure is at Position 1. Their job is police-officer.\n- Answer: police-officer\n\n*Question 4: What is the job of the person who watches thriller?*\n- The person watching Thriller is at Position 2. Their job is journalist.\n- Answer: journalist\n\n**Final Check:**\n- Journalist (Pos 2) is right of Adventure (Pos 1)? Yes.\n- Police-officer (Pos 1) is not the same as filmmaking (Pos 2)? Yes, Pos 1 is collecting.\n\nThe answers in order are: 1, filmmaking, police-officer, journalist.\n\nFinal answer: 1, filmmaking, police-officer, journalist", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -0.025008071}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " break", "logprob": -0.07913375}, {"token": " down", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " logic", "logprob": -0.022542533}, {"token": " step", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -3.6954948e-06}, {"token": " step", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.36509955}, {"token": " determine", "logprob": -0.25411335}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " attributes", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " for", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " each", "logprob": -0.0033232893}, {"token": " person", "logprob": -0.0009711927}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.03292382}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -1.192093e-07}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -8.940737e-06}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -0.013616097}, {"token": ".", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Setup", "logprob": -0.085730955}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.31914845}, {"token": " Grid", "logprob": -0.012467172}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.0095841335}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "We", "logprob": -0.8875812}, {"token": " have", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.69314754}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"tok